# Force LF line endings for files that run on the Linux production server,
# regardless of the local (Windows) git autocrlf setting. Without this, a
# release archive built on Windows (git archive) bakes CRLF into shell
# scripts, which breaks their #!/usr/bin/env shebang on the server.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
